diff --git a/desktop/README.md b/desktop/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..69b3c0b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/desktop/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# Desktop version (not deployed)
+
+This folder holds the original local/desktop implementation of Air Piano
+(`src/pyano.py`), which uses OpenCV + MediaPipe (Python) for hand tracking
+and pygame for audio playback via a local webcam and speakers.
+
+It is **not** used by the deployed web app and is excluded from the Vercel
+build (only `web/` is deployed — see `vercel.json` at the repo root). This
+folder is kept only for running the piano locally as a desktop script.
+
+## Run locally
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+python server.py        # thin Flask server, only used for local dev
+# or run src/pyano.py directly for the original webcam+pygame version
+```
+
+Note: `requirements.txt` currently pins `pygame==1.9.6`, which has no
+prebuilt wheel for modern Python and will fail to build from source on
+recent Python versions. If you hit a build error running this locally,
+bump it to a modern release, e.g.:
+
+```
+pygame>=2.5.2,<3
+```
